        <span itemprop="subject">FIG. 2</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is a graph illustrating dissolution temperature of ULTEM CRS 5001K and CRS 5011K in N-methyl-2-pyrrolidone (NMP) as function of concentration;</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0033">
      </li>
