      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the cation contained in the aforementioned molten salt</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is not specifically limited but may be one or more selected from the group consisting of aromatic quaternary ammonium ions such as 1-ethyl-3-methyl imidazolium, 1-methyl-3-propylimidazolium, 1-methyl-3-isopropylimidazolium, 1-butyl-3-methylimidazolium, 1-ethyl-2,3-dimethyl imidazolium, 1-ethyl-3,4-dimethylimidazolium, N-propylpyridinium, N-butylpyridinium, N-tert-butyl pyridinium and N-tert-pentylpyridinium, and aliphatic quaternary ammonium ions such as N-butyl-N,N,N-trimethylammonium, N-ethyl-N,N-dimethyl-N-propyl ammonium, N-butyl-N-ethyl-N</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0148">
      </li>
