        <span itemprop="definition">is not specifically limited but may be one or more selected from the group consisting of PF6-, (PF3(C2F5)3)-, (PF3(CF3)3)-, BF4-, (BF2(CF3)2)-, (BF2(C2F5)2)-, (BF3(CF3))-, (BF3(C2F5))-, (B(COOCOO)2)- (abbreviated as “BOB-”), CF3SO3- (abbreviated as “Tf-”), C4F9SO3- (abbreviated as “Nf-”), ((CF3SO2)2N)— (abbreviated as “TFSI-”), ((C2F5SO2)2N)- (abbreviated as “BETI-”), ((CF3SO2)(C4F9SO2)N)—, ((CN)2N)— (abbreviated as “DCA-”) and ((CF3SO2)3C)— and (</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0149">
