      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">PF6-</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">there may be desirably used at least one of PF6-, (PF3(C2F5)3)-, (PF3(CF3)3)-, BF4-, (BF2(CF3)2-, (BF2(C2F5)2)-, (BF3(CF3))- , (BF3(C2F5))- , Tf-, Nf-, TFSI-, BETI- and ((CF3SO2)(C4F9SO2)N), which include F, in view of excellent cycle performances.</span>
