      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">ether linkages</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">for example, are beneficially in the 3,3′, 3,4′, 4,3′, or 4,4′ positions, and mixtures thereof, and where Q is as defined above.</span>
