      <div id="p-0046" num="0045" class="description-paragraph"> <figref idrefs="DRAWINGS">FIG. 8C</figref> is a representation of a morphology of <figure-callout id="5001K" label="ULTEM CRS" filenames="US09577235-20170221-D00002.png,US09577235-20170221-D00003.png" state="{{state}}">ULTEM CRS</figure-callout> 5001K;</div>
